          .un_example
            %h6#example_6 Example
            %p
              In the case
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi H
                    %mo =
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{H} =
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9EGrpd"} ∞Grpd
              we have – as in the
              %a{:href => "#PresheavesOnGroupoids"} above example
              – by the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-Grothendieck+construction"} (∞,1)-Grothendieck construction
              an equivalence
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
